# Line endings.
#
# Text files are stored in the repository with LF and checked out with LF on
# every platform, so that a file edited on Windows does not appear as a
# whole-file change to someone on macOS or Linux. Without this, git reports
# every line of a CRLF-saved file as modified.
#
# VS Code, Notepad and the Lean tooling all handle LF on Windows.

* text=auto eol=lf
